# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="immersive_weathering-*.jar,moonlight-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-34)
## SQ-CBO-34 | chain + immersive_weathering-*.jar,moonlight-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 1 of 24: immersive_weathering$
shell ! grep -E "WARN.*immersive_weathering" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "creativebrewing|creativecommon"
## SQ-CBP-04 | chain + Immersive Weathering: compost skips absent compat folders
shell ! grep -h "\[compost\] values for items that do not exist" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep "immersive_weathering:"
shell grep -h "\[compost\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-400 | head -6
shell grep -h "\[compost\] skipped [0-9]* values for items of absent mods" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
